bel="lyrics-like">há- bet, ut ánimam sú¬am</l><l xml:id="m-e54b1ea2-cb70-400a-9c6c-77dcc2f5dc94" facs="#m-d5bec606-2c3a-4c4c-ad12-f46846a2544b" label="lyrics-like">sú-is.</l><l xml:id="m-8a9a79d1-b609-4586-983e-781b0e24b53b" facs="#m-dc737402-582e-4bcd-bd0c-95555d21e7fc" label="lyrics-like">pro a- mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-798fc5f8-1f6a-4a43-b562-1e1505098197" facs="#m-2703761f-0eef-4192-99d2-14f25d977f1f" label="ambiguous">cis</l><l xml:id="m-9620c9c5-51b6-40d5-a5f7-774fd7c9bf40" facs="#m-01657de1-a7cc-4431-b613-98011b541164" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-c267680c-dec8-4112-890a-8dd59eb36083" facs="#m-e1728527-38cd-4873-a18f-6da5e342cd89" label="lyrics-like">"Lementíssime Deus, múnera! ctus Jósaphat Martyr et Póntifex</l><l xml:id="m-ec000601-09e6-4f46-8c14-530f918092ce" facs="#m-3c7b966a-02fc-4723-8572-e01b402f33aa" label="lyrics-like">L haec tua benedictióne perfúnde,l tuus, effúso sánguiné, asséruit. Per</l><l xml:id="m-8604332f-2d65-4a48-b32e-b23f730c4c9f" facs="#m-b80aacd5-ccde-4d80-a3d0-8129c6ce9ebc" label="lyrics-like">et nos in fide confirma: quam san-lDóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b84a77eb-a306-48bf-a99e-1d6fca7a9264" facs="#m-019fb469-1db9-41a1-8e09-d6c94f4c862c" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Ego sum pástor bónus. 438.</l><l xml:id="m-d23b8634-c2a2-40c8-a2d6-9247e10210a5" facs="#m-895c47c8-f234-4017-8d91-a4058ddc5252" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b2ed6656-e53e-42fc-bf12-066b4e8b24ab" facs="#m-3623de13-9f91-4b76-a3fc-2097d5a28f26" label="lyrics-like">NPiritum Dómine fortitúdinis! tvris tui atque Pontíficis vitam pro</l><l xml:id="m-6c466796-427b-40c1-833e-d9613b25c029" facs="#m-1a3c1ed9-597d-4c7c-bdd1-21c70b462a01" label="lyrics-like">O haec nobis tribuat mensa cae- Écclésiae honóre júgiter áluit ad</l><l xml:id="m-37da4c56-fabb-4903-a1fc-88a1dbeb1abd" facs="#m-e24b89e0-374b-42e9-91c0-8c8465a07090" label="lyrics-like">léstis: quae sancti Jósaphat Már-l victóriam. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-f47ffaae-d41d-40bf-8a0f-ccdbe19458ba" facs="#m-4989174c-175c-4b1a-8a96-5366b8d72b38" label="ambiguous">15.</l><l xml:id="m-753ce728-9a7d-4298-bf11-48c05fcceadb" facs="#m-ddf8e929-68b1-4e19-92c1-509d05c88ef5" label="text-like">St. Albert the Great,</l><l xml:id="m-bf366ad9-c95c-44b3-b77a-74516bfd62f0" facs="#m-4d475db1-4103-4285-8d32-4ceec0ff54a6" label="text-like">Bishop, Confessor, and Doctor of the Church. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-2c94c640-642a-4386-a559-68a1bb4a28bd" facs="#m-92f0b21c-d043-4347-80d9-139158b95bac" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers. Ant. at Magn. O Dóctor... beáte Albérte. p. 262e.</l><l xml:id="m-05043513-8eb4-4645-a00f-cf0a8ba10c90" facs="#m-35b358ea-3497-4ce8-a313-328cf08de4e4" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. from the Common of a Doctor, p. 1190. The Credo</l><l xml:id="m-90e3133e-beed-49a5-b09b-9ac7319662a9" facs="#m-07db40bd-8e42-4b28-ac58-c11017a097f0" label="text-like">is said.</l><l xml:id="m-513c3963-95f9-4004-8523-a2e9cf0fe1e9" facs="#m-f19e8a94-aa32-42be-a4dd-271674c0a468" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c0ec8bb1-148d-43a5-bc8a-2a9a78dc28d7" facs="#m-6e849c3e-9272-4b50-a31a-4b9a403d6d14" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Albértum Pon¬ nobis, quaésumus, ita ejus magistérii</l><l xml:id="m-cb5c793a-ddb0-4c73-844b-df4acd5b98d6" facs="#m-45e01f16-ac4d-4f76-8f7a-fc3a372ac996" label="lyrics-like">I tíficem tuum atque Doctórem,</l><l xml:id="m-b4f7b7f7-663a-4096-8e38-f3b850fa258b" facs="#m-5f07c651-71e1-4b72-bed4-8ac2a956f465" label="lyrics-like">inhaerére vestígiis, *ut luce perfécta</l><l xml:id="m-ab74c9d1-96af-49de-8000-0e60f55bb5a7" facs="#m-e03008a9-1200-41ea-b35a-f2aa106f0f03" label="lyrics-like">in humána sapiéntia divinae fideil fruámur in caelis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a62ae0ac-f997-4bf8-926d-715e0d471b7f" facs="#m-e8372a54-a072-45d6-9c7b-4751c8a82a0d" label="lyrics-like">subjiciénda magnum effecísti : t da</l><l xml:id="m-5a4b75c5-f9af-4387-8e49-2f892c120400" facs="#m-f683811b-bca7-4229-aab4-61c75ad52aa1" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-da38ee26-368f-47ec-aa0f-065a4826bc63" facs="#m-d93a715f-4ed8-4929-813b-55f3bc6b709d" label="lyrics-like">NAcrificiis praeséntibus, Dómine,! Albérti intercessióne et exémplo,</l><l xml:id="m-5b8338e3-e17e-4aa5-aef2-4002625d74a6" facs="#m-04c58bb9-77d5-4234-bab9-c93f53a11e1f" label="lyrics-like">pio consequámur afféctu. Per eüm¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9e35eec-1258-4e5d-8e71-a80bfc604c3f" facs="#m-0b2ae497-5bdb-4129-953d-8476a3d176c7" label="lyrics-like">O quaésumus, inténde placátus:</l><l xml:id="m-9015856f-0f67-4eac-bf4e-debe11538e55" facs="#m-dfe70269-6200-49a8-b1b8-f1f6ff14233c" label="lyrics-like">ut quod Passiónis Filii tui Dómini dem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-973b70ab-5dc9-4a72-938e-efde9e5a3acd" facs="#m-8959ecda-ec4e-4dcd-aff0-6a60b5cba114" label="lyrics-like">nostri mystério gérimus, beátil</l><l xml:id="m-0e15c89a-4ac7-4b79-9e8e-925b04fa96b2" facs="#m-9849160a-04a7-49b6-a8cf-bc58be3e4d02" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-2281b6fa-42f1-4757-b762-021c1e0bb2ea" facs="#m-27ac2ce2-9606-4e21-8147-324bd99b2d9a" label="lyrics-like">DER haec sancta quae súmpsi-]dénte beáto Albérto, Confessóre</l><l xml:id="m-b9140934-5a09-49c3-9c37-8622260acff8" facs="#m-74fff992-d5b2-4589-909e-15a22b15a14e" label="lyrics-like">tuo atque Pontifice, perpétua pace</l><l xml:id="m-c8e11e21-9f10-4514-9c29-b68367ad95b0" facs="#m-97902d7e-6832-448a-8c3f-5ebd64435a6e" label="lyrics-like">Lmus, ab hóstium nos, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-a1231b72-fdc4-4a5a-a1fe-17bf55d56812" facs="#m-7d783368-ff75-4851-9d7e-13059857f855" label="lyrics-like">impugnatióne defénde: et interce-lrespirâre concéde. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
